before:
Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
$stream = fopen("php://memory", "w+");
if ($stream === false) { throw new RuntimeException("open failed"); }
try {
    if (fwrite($stream, "read") !== 4) { throw new RuntimeException("short write"); }
    if (!rewind($stream)) { throw new RuntimeException("rewind failed"); }
    $text = stream_get_contents($stream);
    if ($text === false) { throw new RuntimeException("read failed"); }
    echo strlen($text), "\n";
} finally {
    if (!fclose($stream)) { throw new RuntimeException("close failed"); }
}

```

